# 공개 API 계약: project_path_gateway_add_list LIST (일괄 등록, 기능 008 US2, contracts/library-api.md 2·3절)
# 가상 파일 시스템은 call 사이에 바뀐 상태를 이어 주지 않으므로 결과는 같은 call의 op write 원문으로 확인한다.
# add_dir·add_file을 차례로 부른 결과와의 바이트 비교(US2-6)는 원문 끝 LF 처리 사례와 수동 확인 14절로 확인한다.
target lib-session project_path_gateway
layer api
fs file /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/.project-path-gateway
fs file /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.dirs.conf
content PPG_TOOL_DIR=.tools/project-path-gateway
fs file /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.files.conf
fs dir /t/root/src
fs file /t/root/config/app.json
fs file /t/root/Makefile
fs dir /t/root/v1.2

# 수용 시나리오 (US2-1~5)

case add-list-registers-by-shape-in-list-order
fs file /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.dirs.conf
fs file /t/w/list
content SRC=src
content APP_CONFIG=config/app.json
content DOCS=docs
caller-var PROJECT_PATH_GATEWAY_ROOT /t/root
call project_path_gateway_add_list /t/w/list
status 0
out project-path-gateway: 일괄 등록: 디렉터리 2건, 파일 1건, 유지 0건
op copy-preserve /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.dirs.conf /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.dirs.conf
op write /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.dirs.conf SRC=src\nDOCS=docs\n
op move /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.dirs.conf /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.dirs.conf
op copy-preserve /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.files.conf /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.files.conf
op write /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.files.conf APP_CONFIG=config/app.json\n
op move /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.files.conf /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.files.conf
op returned project_path_gateway_add_list 0

case add-list-all-violations-reported-nothing-written
fs file /t/w/list
content src=src
content OUT=../out
content A=a
content A=b
content PPG_TOOL_DIR=tools
content GOOD=good
caller-var PROJECT_PATH_GATEWAY_ROOT /t/root
call project_path_gateway_add_list /t/w/list
status 2
err project-path-gateway: /t/w/list:1: 키 형식이 잘못되었습니다(대문자로 시작, 대문자·숫자·_만 허용): src
err project-path-gateway: /t/w/list:2: 경로에 .. 세그먼트를 쓸 수 없습니다: OUT
err project-path-gateway: /t/w/list:4: 목록 안에서 중복된 키입니다(3번째 줄에서 정의됨): A
err project-path-gateway: /t/w/list:5: 이미 다른 경로로 등록된 키입니다(project-path-gateway.dirs.conf: .tools/project-path-gateway): PPG_TOOL_DIR
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_add_list: 목록 위반 4건이 있어 아무것도 등록하지 않았습니다
op returned project_path_gateway_add_list 2

case add-list-existing-same-entry-is-kept
fs file /t/w/list
content PPG_TOOL_DIR=.tools/project-path-gateway
content SRC=src
caller-var PROJECT_PATH_GATEWAY_ROOT /t/root
call project_path_gateway_add_list /t/w/list
status 0
out project-path-gateway: 일괄 등록: 디렉터리 1건, 파일 0건, 유지 1건
op copy-preserve /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.dirs.conf /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.dirs.conf
op write /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.dirs.conf PPG_TOOL_DIR=.tools/project-path-gateway\nSRC=src\n
op move /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.dirs.conf /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.dirs.conf
op returned project_path_gateway_add_list 0

case add-list-rerun-keeps-all-and-writes-nothing
fs file /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.dirs.conf
content PPG_TOOL_DIR=.tools/project-path-gateway
content SRC=src
fs file /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.files.conf
content APP_CONFIG=config/app.json
fs file /t/w/list
content SRC=src
content APP_CONFIG=config/app.json
caller-var PROJECT_PATH_GATEWAY_ROOT /t/root
call project_path_gateway_add_list /t/w/list
status 0
out project-path-gateway: 일괄 등록: 디렉터리 0건, 파일 0건, 유지 2건
op returned project_path_gateway_add_list 0

case add-list-actual-kind-differs-from-shape
fs file /t/w/list
content MAKEFILE=Makefile
content VERSION_DIR=v1.2
content SRC=src
caller-var PROJECT_PATH_GATEWAY_ROOT /t/root
call project_path_gateway_add_list /t/w/list
status 2
err project-path-gateway: /t/w/list:1: 경로가 디렉터리 모양이지만 실제로는 일반 파일입니다(파일 항목은 이름.확장자 또는 .으로 시작하는 이름): MAKEFILE
err project-path-gateway: /t/w/list:2: 경로가 파일 모양이지만 실제로는 디렉터리입니다(디렉터리 항목은 확장자가 없고 .으로 시작하지 않는 이름): VERSION_DIR
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_add_list: 목록 위반 2건이 있어 아무것도 등록하지 않았습니다
op returned project_path_gateway_add_list 2

case add-list-from-stdin-same-as-file
fs file /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.dirs.conf
stdin SRC=src
stdin APP_CONFIG=config/app.json
stdin DOCS=docs
caller-var PROJECT_PATH_GATEWAY_ROOT /t/root
call project_path_gateway_add_list -
status 0
out project-path-gateway: 일괄 등록: 디렉터리 2건, 파일 1건, 유지 0건
op copy-preserve /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.dirs.conf /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.dirs.conf
op write /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.dirs.conf SRC=src\nDOCS=docs\n
op move /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.dirs.conf /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.dirs.conf
op copy-preserve /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.files.conf /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.files.conf
op write /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.files.conf APP_CONFIG=config/app.json\n
op move /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.files.conf /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.files.conf
op returned project_path_gateway_add_list 0

case add-list-stdin-violation-names-dash
stdin OUT=/abs
caller-var PROJECT_PATH_GATEWAY_ROOT /t/root
call project_path_gateway_add_list -
status 2
err project-path-gateway: -:1: 경로는 /로 시작할 수 없습니다: OUT
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_add_list: 목록 위반 1건이 있어 아무것도 등록하지 않았습니다
op returned project_path_gateway_add_list 2

# 원문 끝 처리와 경로 형식: 줄을 하나씩 등록한 결과와 같다 (FR-034, FR-035, 기능 004 add-last-line-without-lf와 같은 규칙)

case add-list-data-file-without-final-lf
fs file /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.dirs.conf
content-raw A_DIR=a
stdin B_DIR=b
stdin C_DIR=c
caller-var PROJECT_PATH_GATEWAY_ROOT /t/root
call project_path_gateway_add_list -
status 0
out project-path-gateway: 일괄 등록: 디렉터리 2건, 파일 0건, 유지 0건
op copy-preserve /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.dirs.conf /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.dirs.conf
op write /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.dirs.conf A_DIR=a\nB_DIR=b\nC_DIR=c\n
op move /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.dirs.conf /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.dirs.conf
op returned project_path_gateway_add_list 0

case add-list-missing-paths-registered-by-shape
stdin OUT_DIR=build/out
stdin REPORT=build/out/report.html
stdin ENV=.env
caller-var PROJECT_PATH_GATEWAY_ROOT /t/root
call project_path_gateway_add_list -
status 0
out project-path-gateway: 일괄 등록: 디렉터리 1건, 파일 2건, 유지 0건
op copy-preserve /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.dirs.conf /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.dirs.conf
op write /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.dirs.conf PPG_TOOL_DIR=.tools/project-path-gateway\nOUT_DIR=build/out\n
op move /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.dirs.conf /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.dirs.conf
op copy-preserve /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.files.conf /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.files.conf
op write /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.files.conf REPORT=build/out/report.html\nENV=.env\n
op move /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.files.conf /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.files.conf
op returned project_path_gateway_add_list 0

case add-list-same-path-other-key-allowed
stdin TOOLS=.tools/project-path-gateway
caller-var PROJECT_PATH_GATEWAY_ROOT /t/root
call project_path_gateway_add_list -
status 0
out project-path-gateway: 일괄 등록: 디렉터리 1건, 파일 0건, 유지 0건
op copy-preserve /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.dirs.conf /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.dirs.conf
op write /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.dirs.conf PPG_TOOL_DIR=.tools/project-path-gateway\nTOOLS=.tools/project-path-gateway\n
op move /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.dirs.conf /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.dirs.conf
op returned project_path_gateway_add_list 0

case add-list-relative-list-path-from-working-directory
cwd /t/w
fs file /t/w/paths.list
content SRC=src
caller-var PROJECT_PATH_GATEWAY_ROOT /t/root
call project_path_gateway_add_list paths.list
status 0
out project-path-gateway: 일괄 등록: 디렉터리 1건, 파일 0건, 유지 0건
op copy-preserve /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.dirs.conf /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.dirs.conf
op write /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.dirs.conf PPG_TOOL_DIR=.tools/project-path-gateway\nSRC=src\n
op move /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.dirs.conf /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.dirs.conf
op returned project_path_gateway_add_list 0

# 빈 목록 (경계 사례)

case add-list-empty-or-comment-only
stdin # 찾기 결과
stdin
stdin #BUILD_OUT_TXT=build/out.txt
caller-var PROJECT_PATH_GATEWAY_ROOT /t/root
call project_path_gateway_add_list -
call project_path_gateway_add_list /t/w/empty
fs file /t/w/empty
status 0
out project-path-gateway: 일괄 등록: 디렉터리 0건, 파일 0건, 유지 0건
out project-path-gateway: 일괄 등록: 디렉터리 0건, 파일 0건, 유지 0건
op returned project_path_gateway_add_list 0
op returned project_path_gateway_add_list 0

# 인자·초기화 (계약 2절)

case add-list-argument-errors
caller-var PROJECT_PATH_GATEWAY_ROOT /t/root
call project_path_gateway_add_list
call project_path_gateway_add_list a b
call project_path_gateway_add_list \e
status 2
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_add_list: 인자는 LIST 1개여야 합니다
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_add_list: 인자는 LIST 1개여야 합니다
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_add_list: 목록 파일 경로가 비어 있습니다
op returned project_path_gateway_add_list 2
op returned project_path_gateway_add_list 2
op returned project_path_gateway_add_list 2

case add-list-not-initialized
call project_path_gateway_add_list -
status 2
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_add_list: 초기화되지 않았습니다. project_path_gateway_init을 먼저 호출하세요
op returned project_path_gateway_add_list 2

case add-list-after-init
stdin SRC=src
call project_path_gateway_init /t/root/src
call project_path_gateway_add_list -
status 0
out project-path-gateway: 일괄 등록: 디렉터리 1건, 파일 0건, 유지 0건
op returned project_path_gateway_init 0
op copy-preserve /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.dirs.conf /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.dirs.conf
op write /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.dirs.conf PPG_TOOL_DIR=.tools/project-path-gateway\nSRC=src\n
op move /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.dirs.conf /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.dirs.conf
op returned project_path_gateway_add_list 0

# 목록·데이터 파일 오류

case add-list-list-file-missing
caller-var PROJECT_PATH_GATEWAY_ROOT /t/root
call project_path_gateway_add_list /t/w/nope
call project_path_gateway_add_list /t/root/src
status 2
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_add_list: 목록 파일을 읽을 수 없습니다: /t/w/nope
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_add_list: 목록 파일을 읽을 수 없습니다: /t/root/src
op returned project_path_gateway_add_list 2
op returned project_path_gateway_add_list 2

case add-list-crlf-list
stdin SRC=src\r
stdin src=src\r
caller-var PROJECT_PATH_GATEWAY_ROOT /t/root
call project_path_gateway_add_list -
status 2
err project-path-gateway: -:1: CR 문자가 포함되어 있습니다(CRLF 줄 끝인지 확인하세요)
err project-path-gateway: -:2: 키 형식이 잘못되었습니다(대문자로 시작, 대문자·숫자·_만 허용): src (CRLF 줄 끝인지 확인하세요)
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_add_list: 목록 위반 2건이 있어 아무것도 등록하지 않았습니다
op returned project_path_gateway_add_list 2

case add-list-data-file-violation
fs file /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.files.conf
content bad
stdin SRC=src
caller-var PROJECT_PATH_GATEWAY_ROOT /t/root
call project_path_gateway_add_list -
status 2
err project-path-gateway: /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.files.conf:1: KEY=경로 형식이 아닙니다
op returned project_path_gateway_add_list 2

case add-list-data-file-missing
stdin SRC=src
caller-var PROJECT_PATH_GATEWAY_ROOT /t/missing
fs file /t/missing/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.dirs.conf
call project_path_gateway_add_list -
status 2
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_add_list: 데이터 파일을 읽을 수 없습니다: /t/missing/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.files.conf
op returned project_path_gateway_add_list 2

# 쓰기 전 확인과 쓰기 실패 (FR-034, 계약 2절)

case add-list-files-data-file-readonly-nothing-written
fs readonly /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.files.conf
stdin SRC=src
stdin APP_CONFIG=config/app.json
caller-var PROJECT_PATH_GATEWAY_ROOT /t/root
call project_path_gateway_add_list -
status 2
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_add_list: 데이터 파일에 쓰기 권한이 없습니다: /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.files.conf
op returned project_path_gateway_add_list 2

case add-list-dirs-data-file-is-link
fs file /t/elsewhere.conf
fs link /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.dirs.conf /t/elsewhere.conf
stdin SRC=src
caller-var PROJECT_PATH_GATEWAY_ROOT /t/root
call project_path_gateway_add_list -
status 2
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_add_list: 데이터 파일이 심볼릭 링크라 바꿀 수 없습니다: /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.dirs.conf
op returned project_path_gateway_add_list 2

case add-list-tool-directory-readonly
fs readonly /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway
stdin SRC=src
caller-var PROJECT_PATH_GATEWAY_ROOT /t/root
call project_path_gateway_add_list -
status 2
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_add_list: 데이터 파일을 쓸 수 없습니다: /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.dirs.conf
op returned project_path_gateway_add_list 2

case add-list-second-file-fails-after-first-changed
fault move /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.files.conf
stdin SRC=src
stdin APP_CONFIG=config/app.json
caller-var PROJECT_PATH_GATEWAY_ROOT /t/root
call project_path_gateway_add_list -
status 2
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_add_list: 데이터 파일을 쓸 수 없습니다: /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.files.conf (이미 바뀐 데이터 파일: /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.dirs.conf)
op copy-preserve /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.dirs.conf /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.dirs.conf
op write /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.dirs.conf PPG_TOOL_DIR=.tools/project-path-gateway\nSRC=src\n
op move /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.dirs.conf /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.dirs.conf
op copy-preserve /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.files.conf /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.files.conf
op write /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.files.conf APP_CONFIG=config/app.json\n
op move /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.files.conf /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.files.conf
op remove /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.files.conf
op returned project_path_gateway_add_list 2

# 호출 셸 격리 (FR-002)

case add-list-caller-shell-isolation
caller-set -euf
caller-ifs :
stdin SRC=src
caller-var PROJECT_PATH_GATEWAY_ROOT /t/root
call eval project_path_gateway_add_list\s-\s||\sprintf\s'rc=%s\\n'\s"$?"
call eval project_path_gateway_add_list\s/t/w/nope\s2>/dev/null\s||\sprintf\s'rc=%s\\n'\s"$?"
call eval printf\s'alive\\n'
status 0
out project-path-gateway: 일괄 등록: 디렉터리 1건, 파일 0건, 유지 0건
out rc=2
